# Story 7.1: the Containerfile's builder stage COPYs the full repo checkout
# (stations locate their repo root by marker-file walk-up, so a partial
# checkout breaks that) -- this file only strips VCS metadata, local caches,
# and build artifacts that are never needed inside the image.
#
# PATTERN SEMANTICS -- .dockerignore is NOT .gitignore. Docker matches each
# pattern against the whole context-relative path, so a bare `__pycache__/`
# matches ONLY a root-level one and silently misses all 67 nested under
# src/**. Anything that can occur at any depth therefore needs an explicit
# `**/` prefix; entries WITHOUT one below are deliberately root-anchored
# because that is the only place they exist.

.git/
.pixi/

# BMAD Tier-3 runtime scratch -- gitignored, local-only, never git-tracked.
# `_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts` is only a SYMLINK into the active
# project; the real per-project trees (run state, transcripts, patches,
# logs) live under projects/*/ and need their own pattern, or they ride
# along on any checkout where more than one station has run.
_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/
_bmad-output/projects/*/implementation-artifacts

# Deprecated/historical content, not needed at runtime.
archive/

# Herald deck output -- large (84MB in this checkout) and not needed to run
# any station CLI. NOTE the real trade-off: herald's deck duty IS rooted
# here (`deck_pipeline.py`: `repo_root / "presentations" / slug`), so
# `herald deck` subcommands are host-only in this image by design. Story
# 7.4's volume mount is the seam if they ever need to run in-container.
presentations/

# Local secrets/credentials -- must never enter an image layer (these mirror
# entries .gitignore already treats as secret-shaped: .env, .env.github,
# .secrets, .private, SDKs/). `.steward/` is the steward station's own repo-
# root state dir -- keys-inventory.yaml carries identity_path pointers,
# provenance and rotation history, budget.yaml the spend ceilings; neither
# belongs to whoever pulls the image. `.claude/data/` is the gitignored
# mutable runtime cache (cf_atlas.db, vdb/, cve/, mapping caches) that Story
# 7.4 mounts as a volume -- baking today's snapshot in would both leak
# whatever is locally cached and freeze stale state.
.env
.env.github
.secrets
.private
SDKs/
.steward/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/data/

# Python build/test artifacts -- all occur at any depth (each package under
# src/shared/packages/ grows its own), hence `**/`.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.import_linter_cache/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/dist-conda/
**/build_artifacts/

# Node artifacts (present under some presentations/* subprojects)
**/node_modules/

# Editor/IDE metadata
.idea/
.vscode/
.junie/

# Misc local noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
